tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of LIRA: `subdivision 1` / `error 8` is ↯/a.1.8, which the LIRA
# Specification formerly called L108. Subdivision 1 is the validity rules the
# specifications in the `lira` repository define, common to every
# implementation; the subdivisions after it are the modules of the `lira`
# implementation, in the order of their dependencies.

project a lira

  subdivision 1 specification
    description  validity rules of the LIRA Specification and its companions (LIRA Specification §2)
    error 1 InvalidManifest
      description  The manifest does not decode as one BinTEL document conforming to the `lira` schema
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 2 PayloadLength
      description  The decompressed payload is not exactly its declared length
      source  spec/lira.md §8.1
    error 3 InvalidBlobStream
      description  The blob stream is not well-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §8.2
    error 4 MissingBlob
      description  A referenced blob is absent from the payload
      source  spec/lira.md §8.2
    error 5 PayloadHash
      description  The payload hash is not its declared value
      source  spec/lira.md §8.4
    error 6 InvalidTree
      description  A tree metadata blob is not valid
      source  spec/lira.md §9.2
    error 7 OverlayNotMinimal
      description  An overlay is not minimal
      source  spec/lira.md §9.3
    error 8 ApiDivergence
      description  The sections of a release do not present one API
      source  spec/lira.md §9.6
    error 9 LineageMismatch
      description  The last lineage entry is not the release's own snapshot
      source  spec/lira.md §12.2
    error 10 UngradedSuccessor
      description  A successor is not a patch or minor step over its predecessor, and no major was requested
      source  spec/lira.md §12.3
    error 11 DuplicateModule
      description  A buildpath holds more than one release of a module
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 12 NamespaceClash
      description  Two releases of a buildpath claim clashing namespaces
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 13 AbsentDependency
      description  A module named by a dependency is absent from the buildpath
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 14 Unsatisfiable
      description  No release of a module satisfies a requirement on it
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 15 BadDirective
      description  A file does not begin with the fixed eight-byte header
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 16 SigilSpecified
      description  The manifest ends at or before the end of the file, carrying no payload
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 17 VersionRequired
      description  A published release carries no version, or one with major 0
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 18 BuildPinned
      description  A dependency is pinned to a build
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 19 UnpublishedDependency
      description  A required snapshot appears in no published lineage
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 20 VersionProjection
      description  The version is not the projection of the lineage
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 21 BadSignature
      description  A signature does not verify
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 22 UnknownAlgorithm
      description  A signature's algorithm is not implemented by the verifier
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 23 UnknownKey
      description  A signature's key fingerprint matches no trusted key
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 24 BadResource
      description  Resource declarations are ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §11.4
    error 25 IneffectiveResource
      description  A declared resource resolves to nothing, or to content another discipline claims
      source  spec/lira.md §11.4
    error 26 ResourceClash
      description  Two modules export or track overlapping resource paths
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 27 InapplicableDiscipline
      description  A declared discipline atomizes no universe the release carries
      source  spec/lira.md §9.6
    error 28 ProfileViolated
      description  A declared ecosystem profile is violated
      source  spec/lira.md §11.6
    error 29 ProfileWeakens
      description  A profile weakens a core requirement
      source  spec/lira.md §11.6
    error 30 UnrecordedBreak
      description  A step does not preserve a guarantee level which a profile does not record
      source  spec/lira.md §12.4
    error 31 BadIntegration
      description  The integrations of a release are ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §9.5
    error 32 NoAssignment
      description  No integration of a module is satisfiable on the buildpath
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 33 UnrealizedIntegration
      description  A declared integration has no section
      source  spec/lira.md §9.5
    error 34
      description  Content is not claimed in the claiming order
      source  spec/lira.md §11.2
    error 35 BadHostContract
      description  A host contract is ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 36 UnsatisfiedRequirement
      description  No given host contract satisfies a requirement
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 37 NotHostContract
      description  A requirement names a module whose releases are not host contracts
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 38 BadDerivative
      description  A declared derivative hash does not recompute
      source  spec/lira.md §13.6
    error 39 MalformedPayload
      description  The payload is not a well-formed Brotli stream
      source  spec/lira.md §8.1
    error 40 UnimplementedClaim
      description  A declared discipline or profile has no implementation to check it
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 41 AtomsMismatch
      description  A declared atom listing does not recompute from the content
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 42 TagReassigned
      description  A tag names a different release of the module
      source  spec/lira.md §12.6
    error 43
      description  An `app` section does not have the shape its kind admits
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 44
      description  Content of an `app` or `env` section which no discipline claims is not claimed atomless
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 45
      description  An environment is not valid
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 46
      description  A transition of an environment leaves it, or a rolling deployment's intermediate state, invalid
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 47
      description  An environment is named as a dependency
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 48
      description  An `env` section does not have the shape its kind admits
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 49
      description  Two binding addresses are equal, or one is a path-prefix of the other
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 50
      description  A requirement is not satisfied by every concurrently-serving release of its provider
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 51
      description  An increment file's prefix, manifest or header is not valid, or it carries no body
      source  spec/increment.md §3
    error 52
      description  An increment does not apply to its base
      source  spec/increment.md §7
    error 53
      description  An increment's command stream is not well-formed
      source  spec/increment.md §5
    error 54
      description  An increment's priming prefix is not the one its header's parameters fix
      source  spec/increment.md §6
    error 55
      description  The blob stream an increment reconstructs does not verify
      source  spec/increment.md §7
    error 56
      description  An increment is given an identity
      source  spec/increment.md §8

  subdivision 2 format
    error 1 Discipline.Error
      description  A discipline could not atomize the content it claimed
      source src/format/lira.Discipline.scala
      variant 1 Malformed
      variant 2 Duplicate
      variant 3 Unresolved
      variant 4 Nondeterminism

  subdivision 3 derive

  subdivision 4 bundle

  subdivision 5 classfile

  subdivision 6 foreign

  subdivision 7 tasty

  subdivision 8 core
    error 1 DeltaError
      description  A delta file did not parse, named an absent base, or did not reconstruct its release
      source src/core/lira.DeltaFile.scala
    error 2 StoreError
      description  A store object failed re-verification, or an operation addressed an absent object
      source src/core/lira.Store.scala

  subdivision 9 launcher

  subdivision 10 tool
